1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,126
Welcome to Work Online the Smart Way, a free course from Jerry Development.

2
00:00:06,126 --> 00:00:13,000
In this first lesson we will look at what working online really is, and what it is not.

3
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,535
Online work is real work.

4
00:00:15,535 --> 00:00:20,915
You trade a skill or your time for money, just like in any job.

5
00:00:20,915 --> 00:00:28,600
Anyone who promises easy money with no skills and no effort is selling a dream, or a scam.

6
00:00:28,1000 --> 00:00:30,867
There are three common ways.

7
00:00:30,867 --> 00:00:34,133
Freelancing, where you sell a service to clients.

8
00:00:34,133 --> 00:00:37,267
Remote employment, where one company hires you.

9
00:00:37,267 --> 00:00:40,600
And selling your own products, content or courses.

10
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,510
People pay for skills.

11
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:44,157
Writing and translation.

12
00:00:44,157 --> 00:00:45,873
Design and video editing.

13
00:00:45,873 --> 00:00:47,040
Customer support.

14
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,825
Programming and data work.

15
00:00:48,825 --> 00:00:50,541
And teaching or tutoring.

16
00:00:50,541 --> 00:00:52,600
Choose one and get good at it.

17
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:02,945
To start you need one clear skill, a phone or a computer with internet, a simple profile with examples of your work, and patience.

18
00:01:02,945 --> 00:01:07,000
The first weeks are usually slow, and that is normal.

19
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:08,426
Be realistic.

20
00:01:08,426 --> 00:01:10,558
Income takes time to build.

21
00:01:10,558 --> 00:01:13,084
Quality matters more than speed.

22
00:01:13,084 --> 00:01:15,689
And never pay money to get a job.

23
00:01:15,689 --> 00:01:19,400
Real employers pay you, they do not charge you.

24
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:24,994
Your homework: choose one skill and practise it for thirty days.

25
00:01:24,994 --> 00:01:31,000
In the next lesson we will see which skills fit you and how to choose one.

